itle":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T14:31:09-08:00","id":1497020,"title":"","content":"I recently watched Spirtwalker and Bullettrain and found them enjoyable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T14:35:44-08:00","id":1497569,"title":"","content":"Hopefully soon, I will start the Mistborn Trilogy. I spent enough time on hold with Indigo Books to play three games of chess online with a podcast in the background. All I wanted was the phone number for a local outlet. The receptionist repeatedly asked me for my full name, which I declined to provide. It was then explained to me that the stores don't typically sell books to customers who walk in, instead requiring people to provide their name, address, email and banking or credit card information, before shipping it out to you. Trying her best to be of help, the receptionist suggested I go to the store in person to ask the manager to make an exception. As if I'm going to make a trip, just to beg someone to accept cash. I opted for a smaller book store in the city where I used to live who I can trust not share my info and reading list with &quot;our partners&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T17:33:42-08:00","id":1497587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1481606-any-good-movies-games-or-books-you-are-looking-forward-to?p=1497569#post1497569\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hopefully soon, I will start the Mistborn Trilogy. I spent enough time on hold with Indigo Books to play three games of chess online with a podcast in the background. All I wanted was the phone number for a local outlet. The receptionist repeatedly asked me for my full name, which I declined to provide. It was then explained to me that the stores don't typically sell books to customers who walk in, instead requiring people to provide their name, address, email and banking or credit card information, before shipping it out to you. Trying her best to be of help, the receptionist suggested I go to the store in person to ask the manager to make an exception. As if I'm going to make a trip, just to beg someone to accept cash. I opted for a smaller book store in the city where I used to live who I can trust not share my info and reading list with &quot;our partners&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> What the heck kind of scam is this Indigo Books? that is super weird<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T18:37:30-08:00","id":1497598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1481606-any-good-movies-games-or-books-you-are-looking-forward-to?p=1497587#post1497587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> What the heck kind of scam is this Indigo Books? that is super weird</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, it is no more a scam than is Amazon Books. You are not at risk of being overcharged or account fuckery, but you are giving out a lot of personal information for the convenience. I remember thinking that, if consumer data is always sold to the highest 