te the candor there.</div> </div> </div> </div>At least he's owed up to it I guess..<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1481606-any-good-movies-games-or-books-you-are-looking-forward-to?p=1512970#post1512970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In regards to Seagal, the less that is said about him the better and his lack of talent and respect for other people in the same line of work.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, that's not right. At least show a little respect... it's the least people can do.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-28T10:37:44-07:00","id":1513090,"title":"","content":"On a better note. I saw the trailer for the upcoming Mission Impossible Dead Reckoning movie and it looks great and I can\u2019t wait to see the latest adventures of agent Ethan Hunt. Say what you will about how messed Tom Cruises personal life is, the man can still put in great performances.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 05-28-2023, 07:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-29T06:47:33-07:00","id":1513192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1481606-any-good-movies-games-or-books-you-are-looking-forward-to?p=1513090#post1513090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On a better note. I saw the trailer for the upcoming Mission Impossible Dead Reckoning movie and it looks great and I can\u2019t wait to see the latest adventures of agent Ethan Hunt. Say what you will about how messed Tom Cruises personal life is, the man can still put in great performances.</div> </div> </div> </div>Same here. That run of Ghost Protocol, Rogue Nation and Fallout have been great so far. Can't wait to see the new one.<br /> <br /> Of course, the obvious joke with Tom Cruise is that when he will die he will be doing some insane stunt in a Mission Impossible movie that he insists he must perform himself... Was it Fallout or Rogue Nation where you can see that scene where he twists his foot and then he just keeps running with his hurt foot in the scene regardless...? Man, I remember hearing about it and then watching the movie you can actually tell when it happens.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-29T09:58:21-07:00","id":1513203,"title":"","content":"Tom Cruise does come across as an action junkie in these type of films and I appreciate his passion for it. Still there should be times when he should step back and leave it to the professionals.<br /> <br /> Also the same can be said about the insane stunts that Jackie Chan has done for his movies. While it made for great scenes and made the movies more enjoyable for me. But I shake my head at the blooper reels and see some the aftermath of the stunts going wrong and he gets hurt and is wearing casts. At least he is being smarter now in this stage of his life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 05-29-2023, 04:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-22T06:24:49-07:00","id":1515858,"title":"","content":"From what I was looking forward to, it's already out. I was looking forward to the release of John Wick 4. I love this franchise! I hate to believe the ending, eh. These are masterpiece films where everything is beautiful - Keanu Reeves, the camerawork, everything is thought out and looks extremely aesthetically pleasing, the idea and the motifs. Of the games, I was waiting for the release of The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom. I adored this game since childhood. And before the premiere, I had gone through all the chapters of Zelda! Great that my <a href=\"https://pandoraplatinum.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">pandora box arcade</span></a> allows it. And now I do not even know what to expect. It's not like I'm waiting with rapture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27694,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27694-devamona","user":"devamona","date":". 06-23-2023, 09:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27694-devamona","name":"devamona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27694_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-25T12:38:56-07:00","id":1516122,"title":"","content":"I would like to see a Batman Beyond movie with Michael Keaton at some point. But I don\u2019t know who would make a great Terry McGinnis or Barbara Gordon for that matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br />