eally stick with me and I always am game to try them out.</div> </div> </div> </div>I started playing Fallout 4 back in December. I'm only part way in, but I'm having fun with it. It's not my typical style of game, but I played The Outer Worlds a bit back and loved it, so my kid thought I might like Fallout 4. So, I'm working my way through it currently. There is a TON of stuff to do, so I have a feeling I'll be playing it for quite a while..lol.<br /> <br /> <br /> On the movie front, I finally saw The Marvels and thought it was a lot of fun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-30T12:03:16-08:00","id":1529724,"title":"","content":"Fallout New Vegas was my favorite of the series and creating an independent New Vegas was always my go to option as the other factions didn't have the best interests of the people in mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date