ill puts in a good performance and doesn't phone it in.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like it could be good. I'll have to check that out.<br /> <br /> Last movie I watched was 'Monkey Man' directed by and starring Dev Patel, about a man in India who goes out for revenge against the high ranking government people who killed his mother. It's pretty awesome!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-10T13:23:17-08:00","id":1547669,"title":"","content":"Usually you can count on Cage to give a good performance no matter what the film is like. It's like what the late Sir Christopher Lee said more or less.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sooner or later you will be in a bad movie, just don't act bad with the material you have to work with.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-11T22:23:43-08:00","id":1547691,"title":"","content":"I picked up the Destro spot light book from the Energon universe from Robert Kirkman. Already you can see the tensions between Cobra Commander and him with Destro more or less stating that he is working with Cobra Commander and not for him<br /> <br /> Also Destro has some concerns of where did Cobra Commander get this advanced technology that is light years ahead of anything that the best R &amp; D labs are working on and including his own corporation.<br /> <br /> We also get the twins Tomas and Xamot who are rivals to Destro in the arms dealing business and Cobra Commander is using them to put pressure on Destro.<br /> <br /> All in all, I enjoyed the story and how complex and morally grey Destro can be with moments of nobility and pragmatism as he went with a arrangement with General Flagg of GI-JOE.<br /> <br /> I should mention that it's nice that lesser known characteristics like Mercer and Scrap Iron are getting fair amount of screen time and I'm wondering what will cause Mercer to defect later if I recall his bio from back in the day?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 01-12-2025, 01:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2736