eimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-02-06T18:07:43-08:00","id":1558150,"title":"","content":"<b>The Dragon's Demand</b> - It's nice to see that Pathfinder is finally branching out into the video game industry. I was skeptical at first about the approach to make the characters static miniatures, but hearing that they actually change their appearance based on gear and customization has made me warm up to it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Kings of Hell, Chapters 9-12</b> - Came for the lewds, stayed for the... well, the lewds, but the gameplay is also fun. Classic arcade Beat 'em Up style game, where each of the playable characters has a unique and diverse move set from each other.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Solasta II</b> - Despite working with a limited license for the D&amp;D system, the first game was rather enjoyable. I especially liked how your alignment choice affected your character's personality in game, with fully recorded voice lines for each possible option. Plus, the graphics for the sequel look tremendously improved over the first game.","signature":"","edited":{"useri