lue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes the History Channel has many great programs and my only gripe is Ancient Aliens being on the channel as that is speculative fiction and not history.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's far from their only speculative show nowadays, they just don't mark everything as such.<br /> <br /> Overall the idea of the channel is great, and the channel used to be good long ago. But Ancient Aliens isn't just an exception, it marked their inflection point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-14T12:47:32-07:00","id":1564749,"title":"","content":"I know that having Curse Of Oak Island, Rust Valley Restorers and Skin Walker Ranch certainly don't fit on the History Channel, but I still think that the History Channel has some good programs Greatest Mysteries, Escapes, Secrets Declassified and Modern Marvels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-10-14T